// إعداد Workers للنشر من مستودع GitHub (حساب Cloudflare الخاص بالمشروع).
// بعد أول إنشاء لمخزن R2: wrangler r2 bucket create ras-platform-cache
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "ras-platform",
  "main": ".open-next/worker.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "compatibility_flags": ["nodejs_compat", "global_fetch_strictly_public"],
  "assets": {
    "directory": ".open-next/assets",
    "binding": "ASSETS"
  },
  "observability": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "r2_buckets": [
    {
      "binding": "NEXT_INC_CACHE_R2_BUCKET",
      "bucket_name": "ras-platform-cache"
    }
  ],
  "durable_objects": {
    "bindings": [
      { "name": "NEXT_CACHE_DO_QUEUE", "class_name": "DOQueueHandler" },
      { "name": "NEXT_TAG_CACHE_DO_SHARDED", "class_name": "DOShardedTagCache" }
    ]
  },
  "migrations": [
    {
      "tag": "ras-platform-v1",
      "new_sqlite_classes": ["DOQueueHandler", "DOShardedTagCache"]
    }
  ]
}
